# Provide split view

## Requirement

Provide a Split View mode with editable source and rendered preview side by side.

## Traceability

- `inputs/externals/objectives.md` · Specific objectives 4
- `inputs/externals/definitions.md` · 4. Editing modes / Split View

## Verification

Verify the stated behavior through a focused acceptance test or documented inspection. Detailed test cases will be defined during design.
